---
// The app-engine lab (docs/motor-unico-wasm.md, phase 1). A page rather than a static
// public/…/index.html so /lab/app-engine/ resolves under `astro dev` as well as on
// Netlify. The engine, the worklet and the sounds stay in public/lab/app-engine/.
export const prerender = true;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Motor de la app · laboratorio</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Space+Mono:wght@700&display=swap">
<style is:inline>
  :root {
    --bg: #F6F7F9; --card: #FFFFFF; --muted: #E8EAED; --line: #DADCE2; --tx: #14181F; --soft: #606876;
    --faint: #7E8695; --ac: #6A1FEA; --acs: #EFE8FD; --ok: #1B6B50; --warn: #926E14; --bad: #DC2828;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--tx); font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  main { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 16px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  h1 { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--soft); line-height: 1.45; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .lbl { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--faint); }
  .mono { font-family: 'Space Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  button { font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .play { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 32px; border: 0; background: var(--ac); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(106,31,234,.32); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .play:disabled { opacity: .4; }
  .cap { height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--muted); color: var(--tx); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .cap.on { background: var(--acs); border-color: rgba(106,31,234,.55); color: var(--ac); }
  .primary { height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; border: 0; background: var(--ac); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; padding: 0 18px; }
  input[type=range] { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--ac); }
  .now { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; }
  .chord { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; }
  .dots { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
  .dots i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--muted); }
  .dots i.on { background: var(--ac); }
  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  .stat { background: var(--muted); border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .stat b { font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace; font-size: 16px; }
  .spinner { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 11px; border: 3px solid var(--muted); border-top-color: var(--ac); animation: spin .8s linear infinite; flex-shrink: 0; }
  @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--faint); }
  .err { color: var(--bad); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div>
    <span class="lbl">Laboratorio · fase 1</span>
    <h1>El motor de la app, en el navegador</h1>
  </div>
  <p>Esto suena con el mismo código C++ que la app de Android (<span class="mono">native_audio.cpp</span>), compilado a WebAssembly y ejecutado en el hilo de audio del navegador. No usa nada del motor actual de la web.</p>

  <div class="card" id="loadCard">
    <button class="primary" id="load">Cargar el motor</button>
    <p id="loadInfo">Descarga el motor (~390 KB), los 3 sonidos por defecto (2,6 MB) y la batería.</p>
    <p class="err" id="error" hidden></p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="player" hidden>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="play" id="play" aria-label="Reproducir">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" id="playIcon"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
      </button>
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;">
        <div class="row" style="gap: 6px;"><span class="lbl">Tempo</span><b class="mono" id="bpmLabel">95</b><span class="note">BPM</span></div>
        <input type="range" id="bpm" min="60" max="180" value="95" aria-label="Tempo">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <button class="cap on" data-song="0">Pop</button>
      <button class="cap" data-song="1">Reggaeton</button>
      <span style="flex: 1"></span>
      <button class="cap" id="metro">Clic</button>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <span class="lbl" style="width: 64px;">Tocar</span>
      <button class="cap on" data-loop="-1">Todo</button>
      <button class="cap" data-loop="0">Verso</button>
      <button class="cap" data-loop="1">Coro</button>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <span class="lbl" style="width: 64px;">Silenciar</span>
      <button class="cap" data-mute="0">Batería</button>
      <button class="cap" data-mute="1">Piano</button>
      <button class="cap" data-mute="2">Guitarra</button>
      <button class="cap" data-mute="3">Bajo</button>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <span class="lbl" style="width: 64px;">Reverb</span>
      <input type="range" id="reverb" min="0" max="60" value="22" style="flex: 1;" aria-label="Reverb">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="nowCard" hidden>
    <span class="lbl" id="where">Parado</span>
    <div class="now">
      <span class="chord" id="chord">—</span>
      <div class="dots" id="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="stressCard" hidden>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
        <b style="font-size: 14px;">Atascar la interfaz</b>
        <p>Bloquea la página 400 ms de cada segundo, como una web muy pesada. El círculo se congela; el audio no debería cortarse.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="cap" id="stress">Activar</button>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Prueba también: bloquea la pantalla o cambia de app con la música sonando.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card" id="statsCard" hidden>
    <span class="lbl">Medidas</span>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Carga del motor</span><b id="loadPct">—</b></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Bloques tarde (motor)</span><b id="late">0</b></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Frecuencia</span><b id="rate">—</b></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Latencia salida</span><b id="latency">—</b></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Cortes (Chrome)</span><b id="glitches">—</b></div>
      <div class="stat"><span class="lbl">Carga inicial</span><b id="startup">—</b></div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Carga del motor = parte del tiempo de cada bloque de audio que usa el motor (por debajo del 100 % no hay cortes). «Cortes» solo lo informa Chrome.</p>
    <button class="cap" id="resetStats" style="align-self: flex-start;">Reiniciar medidas</button>
  </div>
</main>
<script type="module" src="/lab/app-engine/app.js" is:inline></script>
</body>
</html>
